        <item>
            <title>1.2.0</title>
            <pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 10:25:15 -0500</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>5</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.2.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h3>What's new in Snapwise 1.2.0</h3><ul>
<li>Resize shapes after drawing: select a rectangle, oval or redaction box and drag its handles (hold Shift to keep proportions).</li>
<li>Drag the ends of arrows and lines to adjust them.</li>
<li>New corner-radius slider for rectangles.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
