            <description><![CDATA[<h3>What's new in Snapwise 1.1.0</h3><ul>
<li>Find Sensitive Info now shows its work: Snapwise visibly reads your screenshot, highlights what it finds, and hides it, with a one-click Undo.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
