        <item>
            <title>1.0.1</title>
            <pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 14:36:08 -0500</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>3</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.0.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h3>What's new in Snapwise 1.0.1</h3><ul>
<li>Choose what's in the menu bar menu: show, hide and reorder items in Settings › Menu.</li>
<li>Delayed capture now counts down before you pick an area or window, so open menus and hover states get captured.</li>
<li>Fixed the version number shown in About and used for updates.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
